From: ksg136 <ksg136@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:57:08 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Build routines around known limitations and overlay a
 same-height standard body

Local routine generation now follows the server's limitation rules: known
body parts exclude tagged exercises, while unknown or high-risk conditions
still require a consultation. The body view overlays a standard body built
from height and sex alone instead of requiring birth date and literature means.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
